{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.ManifoldVolumeBridge","lean:module:QOU.Knot.FiveTwoVolumeConstant","lean:module:QOU.Encounter.FigureEightVolumeBridge","lean:module:QOU.Knot.FiveTwoVolumeChord"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.vol_ne_zero_of_realises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.vol_ne_zero_of_realises","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Encounter/FiveTwoVolumeBridge.lean#L159-L164","doc":"**The 5₂ volume is not zero**, hence the triangulation is not degenerate — the\ndegenerate-model check applied to the value, matching the 4₁ file. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.vol_pos_of_realises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.vol_pos_of_realises","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Encounter/FiveTwoVolumeBridge.lean#L149-L157","doc":"**Positivity through the bridge — derived, not assumed.**\n\nThe 5₂ counterpart of `FigureEightVolumeBridge.vol_pos_of_realises`.  Its absence was\nrecorded in this file's header as an honest gap; the chord inequality closed it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.VOL_5_2_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.VOL_5_2_pos","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Encounter/FiveTwoVolumeBridge.lean#L137-L147","doc":"**`VOL_5_2` is positive** — with no positivity statement about `BlochWigner_lob`\nanywhere in the proof.\n\n`Cl_2_pi_div_three_pos` bounds `VOL_4_1 = 2·Cl₂(π/3)` below; the chord inequality puts\n`VOL_5_2` above it.  See the module header for why the direct route (a Clausen special\nvalue, as at 4₁) is unavailable at this shape and remains so. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.vol_lt_of_realises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.vol_lt_of_realises","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Encounter/FiveTwoVolumeBridge.lean#L122-L135","doc":"**The 5₂ manifold has strictly larger volume than the 4₁ manifold** — the\ninequality itself, not merely the transport of it.\n\nDischarges the right-hand side of `vol_lt_iff_of_realises` with\n`QOU.Knot.FiveTwoVolumeChord.VOL_4_1_lt_VOL_5_2`, which is proved from Rivin's strict\nconcavity along the chord from the regular ideal shape to the 5₂ shape — keyed on the\nexact constants throughout, never on `MostowRigidity`'s truncated literals. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.vol_lt_iff_of_realises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.vol_lt_iff_of_realises","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Encounter/FiveTwoVolumeBridge.lean#L102-L120","doc":"**The 4₁ and 5₂ volumes are comparable through the bridge.**\n\nIf one manifold is realised by the 4₁ triangulation and another by the 5₂\ntriangulation, their volumes stand in the same relation as the two exact constants.\nStated as an equivalence because it is the transport statement: it says the bridge\ncarries the comparison faithfully, whatever the comparison turns out to be.  The\ncomparison itself is now proved — `vol_lt_of_realises` below discharges the right-hand\nside — but the two are worth keeping separate, because `MostowRigidity`'s version of the\nsame comparison discharges by `norm_num` on the two **truncated literals**, which is a\nstatement about the decimals and not about the constants. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.vol_eq_three_blochWigner_of_realises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.vol_eq_three_blochWigner_of_realises","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Encounter/FiveTwoVolumeBridge.lean#L95-L100","doc":"The same, as the Bloch–Wigner sum over the three tetrahedra of the 5₂\ntriangulation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.vol_eq_VOL_5_2_of_realises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Encounter.FiveTwoVolumeBridge.vol_eq_VOL_5_2_of_realises","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Encounter/FiveTwoVolumeBridge.lean#L84-L93","doc":"**A manifold realised by the 5₂ triangulation has volume exactly `VOL_5_2`.**\n\nKeyed on the exact constant, not on `MostowRigidity.knot5_2`'s truncated literal — see\nthe module header. Composes the bridge's transport with the corpus's sorry-free\n`fiveTwoTriangulation_volume`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}